This package bundles the following third-party material.

World map (resources/geo/world-countries.json, resources/geo/countries.php,
resources/dist/filament-enhanced-charts-map-world.js)
  Derived from Natural Earth, "Admin 0 - Countries", 1:110m scale
  (ne_110m_admin_0_countries, https://www.naturalearthdata.com/,
  https://github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector).
  Licence: public domain — "All versions of Natural Earth raster + vector map
  data ... are in the public domain. You may use the maps in any manner,
  including modifying the content and design, electronic dissemination, and
  offset printing." (https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/)
  Changes: properties reduced to the ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 code (`iso`) and the
  English name (`name`); coordinates rounded to two decimals; Northern Cyprus
  merged into Cyprus and Somaliland into Somalia (they have no ISO code of
  their own); Antarctica left out; label points kept as country centroids.
  Natural Earth marks some borders as disputed; the map takes no position on
  them.

